# cms module

Load `.cursor/skills/cms/SKILL.md` for full patterns. Short rules:

- Routes only under `cms/src/app/[locale]/`
- RSC → `getServerTranslation`; client → `useTranslation` + `useParams().locale`
- User-facing copy → i18n JSON; keep `en` and `vi` keys in sync
- Links → `getLocalizedPath(locale, path)`
- UI primitives → shadcn under `src/components/ui/` (`components.json` style `base-nova`)
- Locale redirect → `src/proxy.ts`
- Alias `@/*` → `cms/src/*`
- Git commands from `cms/` (separate `.git`)

Never Do details live in the skill — follow them.
